      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those subjective \"spikes\" are fascinating but challenging because they exist in your domain of conscious awareness while the actual events happen outside that window. To formalize this, you would need to record these events yourself immediately after they occur, capturing the intensity, context, and resulting outcome alongside the exact time of the feeling. A common approach is to treat them as noisy labels or \"noisy ground truth,\" running benchmarking tests to see if your gut intuition consistently improves predictive accuracy beyond chance or data-driven baselines. This process requires rigorous self-tracking and statistical validation before you can trust such a cognitive model as a reliable forecasting tool.",
